<title>RUSSIA: Rostelekom may issue ADRs this year.</title>
<headline>Rostelekom may issue ADRs this year.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian long-distance telephone operator Rostelekom may issue Level Two or Level Three American Depositary Receipts this year, a top company official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Chief Executive Oleg Belov told a briefing that Rostelekom had to present reports on its activities over the past three years to the U.S. Securities Exchange Commission and resolve its plans to hand over a 38-percent state-owned stake to telecoms holding company Svyazinvest.</p>
</text>
